{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S03\",\"screen\":\"说过重要的话，心还停在那句话里面\",\"source\":\"像说过一句重要的话以后，人还停留在那句话里面，有一点陶醉，有一点走神。\",\"type\":\"6\",\"severity\":\"严重\",\"why\":\"屏幕去掉了比喻性的“像”，变成已经说过重要的话，与线里没想好怎么开口、念头就淡了相冲突。\"},{\"sec\":\"S06\",\"screen\":\"亲近的人进不了心里\",\"source\":\"即使是最亲密的人，也没法陪你走进心里的每一个角落。\",\"type\":\"8\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿说的是亲近的人无法陪伴自己走进内心的每一个角落，屏幕却变成对方完全进不了心里，扩大了原意。\"},{\"sec\":\"S13\",\"screen\":\"真往回藏【反倒更难受】（第31秒出现）／刚才想对他好也是真心的（第35秒出现）\",\"source\":\"刚才想对对方好也是真心的，真要往回藏，自己反倒更难受。\",\"type\":\"7\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿先表达刚才想对对方好是真心的，再表达往回藏会更难受；屏幕把两层意思的出现顺序倒置了。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0cd66618-a32f-488d-a75c-7f959025cf59", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T030722666592Z", "elapsed_seconds": 611.593, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T03:17:34.273272+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "29bf5ff53914bdcc90af5eb83f3bc3cc658a9cf1a4c1cc8928a1fd5860936bb1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fa